         "text": "Differentiate both sides of \\( \\tan\\left(g(x)\\right) = \\frac{- 3 x - 9}{10} \\) with respect to x. The chain rule on the left gives \\( \\sec^{2}\\left(g(x)\\right) \\cdot g'(x) = - \\frac{3}{10} \\).",
