      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "Express the trigonometric factor in x by the Pythagorean identity for tangent and secant: \\( \\sec^{2}\\left(g(x)\\right) = 1 + \\tan^{2}\\left(g(x)\\right) = \\left(- \\frac{3 x}{10} - \\frac{9}{10}\\right)^{2} + 1 \\).",
         "rule_named": "Pythagorean identity on the principal branch"
